<title>BELGIUM: Tessenderlo Q1 1997 pre-tax up 30 pct.</title>
<headline>Tessenderlo Q1 1997 pre-tax up 30 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgian chemicals group Tessenderlo said on Thursday its 1997 first-quarter pre-tax profit rose about 30 percent to 892 million francs against 683 million in the year-earlier period.</p>
<p>Consolidated turnover rose 15.6 percent to 14.33 billion francs, it said in a statement.</p>
<p>The company also said it was considering a 10-for-one stock split and would propose a capital increase, reserved for the group's workforce.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6815, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
